  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "*soupir*<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002A0073006F0075007000690072002A001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Salut, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200021002000530061006C00750074002C0020001000020100000000200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qu’il t’arrive ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C0020007420190061007200720069007600650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi tu soupires ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F006900200074007500200073006F0075007000690072006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je repensais à Rayquaza et surtout à tout ce qu’a\nfait Anya... Elle est épatante, tu trouves pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il s’est passé quelque chose ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020007320190065007300740020007000610073007300E90020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F007300650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux en parler ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020007600650075007800200065006E0020007000610072006C006500720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... C’est gentil de ta part de t’inquiéter pour moi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E002000432019006500730074002000670065006E00740069006C002000640065002000740061002000700061007200740020006400650020007420190069006E00710075006900E900740065007200200070006F007500720020006D006F0069002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’avoue que j’ai la tête ailleurs...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe pense à mon ancienne coloc... Tu sais, celle\nqu’a été recrutée pour devenir danseuse pro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense aussi à mon frère... Enfin, je devrais\ndire « demi-frère », car on a pas la même mère.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as un frère ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200061007300200075006E00200066007200E8007200650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parle-moi de lui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006C0065002D006D006F00690020006400650020006C00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est plus âgé que moi et il s’appelle Tierno.\nJe l’ai jamais rencontré. On s’est jamais parlé...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... mais je sais que lui aussi, il est danseur pro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout ça me fait ressentir une drôle de pression...\nMon frère et mon amie ont réussi, alors que moi...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout ira bien.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0075007400200069007200610020006200690065006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es toi, ne te compare pas aux autres.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200065007300200074006F0069002C0020006E006500200074006500200063006F006D0070006100720065002000700061007300200061007500780020006100750074007200650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est gentil de dire ça... Mais toi, t’es très fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe.\nLa confiance en toi, ça te vient naturellement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... J’ai une idée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004A20190061006900200075006E006500200069006400E90065002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça te dirait qu’on fasse un combat, toi et moi ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPeut-être que si je réussis à bien me défendre,\nje pourrai retrouver un peu de confiance en moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’attends sur le terrain d’entraînement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190061007400740065006E0064007300200073007500720020006C00650020007400650072007200610069006E0020006420190065006E00740072006100EE006E0065006D0065006E0074002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien faire ce combat contre moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E00200066006100690072006500200063006500200063006F006D00620061007400200063006F006E0074007200650020006D006F00690020003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends un peu.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E0064007300200075006E0020007000650075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, j’ai hâte qu’on commence !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006A2019006100690020006800E2007400650020007100752019006F006E00200063006F006D006D0065006E0063006500200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci ! Ça va être un beau combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200021002000C70061002000760061002000EA00740072006500200075006E0020006200650061007500200063006F006D00620061007400200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Staross ! Brille comme la plus belle des étoiles !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400610072006F00730073002000210020004200720069006C006C006500200063006F006D006D00650020006C006100200070006C00750073002000620065006C006C00650020006400650073002000E90074006F0069006C00650073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rudi ! T’as été incroyable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520075006400690020002100200054201900610073002000E9007400E900200069006E00630072006F007900610062006C00650020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cornélia ?! Depuis quand t’es là ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0072006E00E9006C006900610020003F002100200044006500700075006900730020007100750061006E0064002000742019006500730020006C00E00020003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis arrivée peu après le début du combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007300750069007300200061007200720069007600E900650020007000650075002000610070007200E800730020006C00650020006400E900620075007400200064007500200063006F006D0062006100740020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi vous vous battiez ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F006900200076006F0075007300200076006F007500730020006200610074007400690065007A0020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis un peu perdue, en ce moment...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe pensais retrouver un peu confiance en moi\naprès un combat contre <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais enfin, t’es une fille extra !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200065006E00660069006E002C0020007420190065007300200075006E0065002000660069006C006C00650020006500780074007200610020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comment ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065006E0074002000E700610020003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as sauvé Illumis et tous ses habitants avec\nla Team MZ, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00542019006100730020007300610075007600E900200049006C006C0075006D0069007300200065007400200074006F0075007300200073006500730020006800610062006900740061006E0074007300200061007600650063000A006C00610020005400650061006D0020004D005A002C0020006E006F006E0020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faut pas te comparer à <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nC’est une dinguerie à quel point <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿซil est fortelle est forte !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nT’as rien à y gagner ! T’es super comme t’es !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et cette danse que tu fais, synchronisée avec\nStaross ? C’est ta marque de fabrique !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cornélia...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0072006E00E9006C00690061002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais, quand je suis devenue l’Héritière,\nmoi aussi j’avais la pression. Comme toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après tout ce temps, je comprends toujours pas\ntous les mécanismes de la Méga-Évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis l’Héritière, mais de quoi j’ai hérité ?\nQu’est-ce que je dois transmettre ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe me pose plein de questions !\nT’imagines un peu, la migraine ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 156
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais plutôt que de rester paralysée par tout ça,\nj’ai décidé de faire ce que je pouvais, pas à pas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que je comprends...\nMerci pour tes conseils, Cornélia !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F0069007300200071007500650020006A006500200063006F006D007000720065006E00640073002E002E002E000A004D006500720063006900200070006F00750072002000740065007300200063006F006E007300650069006C0073002C00200043006F0072006E00E9006C0069006100200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et toi aussi, merci pour ton soutien,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200074006F0069002000610075007300730069002C0020006D006500720063006900200070006F0075007200200074006F006E00200073006F0075007400690065006E002C000A001000020100000000200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis là à donner des conseils... mais en vrai,\nc’est moi qui aurais besoin d’aide !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah bon ? Il y a un problème ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200062006F006E0020003F00200049006C002000790020006100200075006E002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D00650020003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ben oui ! C’est quoi, au final, la Méga-Évolution ?\nQuelqu’un aurait la solution, par ici ? Au secours !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    }
  ],
